  "cut": "Move Freshness service/policy and scheduling/projection composition out of public facade implementations into concrete Runtime operations. Move raw Container append+sync, write-admission checks and owner identity/physical reads into owner-lifecycle operations. Keep public supported Cva method signatures as delegates. Keep canonical Freshness computations over allowed Freshness/Memory/Graph inputs, and preserve all accepted-use, birth, event, receipt ordering and error outcomes.",
  "preserved_contracts": [
    "accepted-use receipts validate and append before projection updates in original order",
    "Freshness birth/admit/event/reconciliation and replay preserve current ordering and durable bytes",
    "owner write admission and physical append/sync stay bound to the mounted owner",
    "public Cva API and return/error values remain unchanged",
    "Dream initial settlement trace and idempotency behavior remain unchanged",
    "no target DAG edge, blanket component-map reclassification or duplicate mutable state"
  ],
